CHAPTER.VERS:
Now therefore, in the sight of all Israel, the assembly of Yahweh, and in the audience of our God, observe and seek out all the commandments of Yahweh your

          {+}
         God; that you

          {+}
         may possess this good land, and leave it for an inheritance to your

          {+}
         sons after you

          {+}
         forever.
